WEBVTT

00:36.619 --> 00:38.121
TENGOKU-DAIMAKYO

00:38.955 --> 00:40.165
TENGOKU-DAIMAKYO

01:38.473 --> 01:41.935
No more human experiments!

01:42.018 --> 01:44.771
Cutting off a leg
just for your experiments

01:44.854 --> 01:46.356
isn't something a human would do!

01:46.439 --> 01:47.649
FREE THE PATIENTS
STOP HUMAN EXPERIMENTS

01:47.732 --> 01:50.068
-No more human experiments!
-That's right!

01:56.616 --> 02:00.245
That bastard!
Well, let's do it right here!

02:10.296 --> 02:12.340
Miss Mizuhashi!

02:13.758 --> 02:16.011
That's foul! Violence is wrong!

02:16.094 --> 02:19.097
-Violence is wrong!
-No violence!

02:19.180 --> 02:21.850
One rock, and all hell breaks loose.

02:21.933 --> 02:24.894
They are just a group
of revelers with no beliefs.

02:25.729 --> 02:28.648
No, they are acting strangely today.

02:29.315 --> 02:31.943
I thought they'd be emotional for a while.

02:32.027 --> 02:34.237
I can't believe
they left after just one rock.

02:34.988 --> 02:38.533
It's like it served another purpose.

02:39.200 --> 02:42.162
Yeah. They're going to use this rock
as an excuse to do anything.

02:42.245 --> 02:44.539
They may demand something.

02:44.622 --> 02:47.250
Even though they threw the stone first?

02:47.751 --> 02:49.294
Hmm?

02:49.377 --> 02:53.381
They're the ones who think
"what we do is an expression of what we do

02:53.465 --> 02:55.508
and what others do is an attack."

02:57.010 --> 02:59.137
-Leader!
-Are you okay?

02:59.220 --> 03:02.140
-Leader!
-Leader!

03:02.223 --> 03:03.516
Excuse me.

03:03.600 --> 03:04.809
Let me through!

03:15.570 --> 03:17.655
I was able to confirm
from the guard on watch.

03:18.656 --> 03:21.159
He said the monsters
in the basement are really dead.

03:23.161 --> 03:26.498
We must not miss this chance!

03:28.208 --> 03:29.834
Listen up, everyone.

03:30.752 --> 03:33.088
The leader

03:33.713 --> 03:34.714
is dead.

03:41.388 --> 03:44.724
The leader was subjected
to inhumane experimentation

03:44.808 --> 03:46.309
and had her leg cut off.

03:46.893 --> 03:50.021
And yet, she still stood up
to save the test subject

03:50.105 --> 03:52.691
held captive by the Immortal Order.

03:54.359 --> 03:56.236
Defeat the enemies of the leader!

03:56.820 --> 03:58.154
Grab your weapons!

04:01.616 --> 04:03.034
Hey, hey.

04:15.797 --> 04:17.173
Doctor!

04:17.674 --> 04:20.301
Doctor, my prosthetic hand
is making strange noises.

04:24.723 --> 04:28.143
You can ask someone
to spray it with oil or silicone spray.

04:28.727 --> 04:31.396
Just this one place is enough.

04:32.063 --> 04:37.444
Doctor, this child doesn't know
how to control the strength.

04:37.527 --> 04:39.320
Can't you do something about it?

04:39.404 --> 04:41.948
You get used to it.
You just have to get used to it.

04:42.449 --> 04:44.117
-Doctor!
-Dr. Usami.

04:44.200 --> 04:45.201
Let's go.

04:46.244 --> 04:47.245
Is it okay?

04:47.996 --> 04:49.205
There is no end to it.

04:51.624 --> 04:52.667
In here.

04:54.294 --> 04:58.089
I want you to see if you can make her die
using the same method you used

04:58.173 --> 05:00.008
to kill the monsters in the basement.

05:05.638 --> 05:06.639
This is…

05:09.059 --> 05:11.102
the curtain that Mizuhashi mentioned.

05:15.565 --> 05:17.025
Th-They say

05:18.526 --> 05:21.780
it's the cornerstone
of their patients' treatment.

05:29.704 --> 05:33.208
Why don't you just turn off the machines
if you want to let her die?

05:34.542 --> 05:37.796
If I did, she'll become a monster
like the ones in the basement.

05:39.214 --> 05:42.801
She's going to become a Man-eater?

05:43.968 --> 05:46.304
Are Man-eaters human?

05:48.056 --> 05:51.351
If you ask me if they are human,
they are a little different.

05:51.434 --> 05:53.937
They are former humans
who died from a disease

05:54.688 --> 05:56.064
that turns them into monsters.

05:57.065 --> 06:00.944
The facilities here were created
to prolong her life as a human

06:01.027 --> 06:03.196
after she developed that disease.

06:04.489 --> 06:06.241
To slow the progression,

06:06.741 --> 06:10.745
you have to cut out
the part of the body that is diseased.

06:12.539 --> 06:16.501
Still, once it develops,

06:17.085 --> 06:19.045
you will eventually relapse.

06:19.629 --> 06:21.923
And the diseased parts
will need to be removed again.

06:22.507 --> 06:25.593
If the body can no longer function,
it is supplemented by the machines.

06:26.094 --> 06:29.514
I've been doing all this for a long time.

06:30.682 --> 06:34.310
But her body has reached its limit.

06:36.980 --> 06:39.399
She may be able to die as a human

06:40.191 --> 06:43.486
with the method you used
to kill the monsters in the basement.

06:48.491 --> 06:50.326
It's our only hope.

07:19.105 --> 07:20.106
I can do it.

07:22.525 --> 07:23.818
You can?

07:23.902 --> 07:25.987
But what does she want?

07:27.197 --> 07:29.366
She can communicate through that tablet.

07:29.866 --> 07:32.869
And she can hear us.

07:43.713 --> 07:45.632
I WANT

07:45.715 --> 07:48.134
I WANT TO SEE

07:48.218 --> 07:51.388
THE SKY ONE LAST TIME

07:56.184 --> 07:58.436
Can she be taken outside?

07:59.187 --> 08:00.855
She can't be removed from the machines.

08:07.570 --> 08:08.613
From here.

08:13.827 --> 08:14.911
To here.

08:15.870 --> 08:17.247
It's only this far.

08:20.792 --> 08:22.293
We'll help you.

08:23.128 --> 08:25.380
If you can't do that,
I won't do it either.

08:30.510 --> 08:34.055
Good. That's right. Softly.

08:34.139 --> 08:35.390
Softly.

08:38.143 --> 08:40.854
-Place that close to her.
-Got it.

08:42.397 --> 08:44.315
Put this by her side as well.

08:46.276 --> 08:48.737
Looks like I need to extend this.

08:49.446 --> 08:51.698
I need you to get into her line of sight

08:52.365 --> 08:54.784
because she won't be able
to hear anything for a moment.

09:17.557 --> 09:19.392
THAT HURTS! YOU IDIOT!

09:19.476 --> 09:21.186
Sorry, sorry.

09:22.479 --> 09:23.688
Calling me an idiot…

09:32.113 --> 09:33.948
All the stairs are blocked!

09:34.032 --> 09:35.742
-Go around!
-Let's go!

09:35.825 --> 09:36.826
Geez.

09:38.578 --> 09:40.455
<i>The time has come.</i>

09:41.456 --> 09:42.957
Hey!

09:44.542 --> 09:46.169
The gen--

09:58.932 --> 10:02.519
It's retribution
for killing Miss Mizuhashi!

10:03.269 --> 10:04.938
Yeah!

10:05.021 --> 10:07.273
Gotta do what must be done!

10:07.774 --> 10:09.192
Rush in through here!

10:10.735 --> 10:11.736
This is bad!

10:12.320 --> 10:15.365
The Whiteshirts just showed up,
armed to the teeth!

10:15.448 --> 10:19.244
Damn. I thought
they weren't going to be violent.

10:20.453 --> 10:25.083
Everyone move upstairs!
Those who can move, assist the wounded!

10:49.733 --> 10:52.402
Hey, it's kind of noisy.

10:53.236 --> 10:54.279
Just leave it alone.

10:56.531 --> 10:59.075
That room's a decoy! Watch out for it!

12:52.272 --> 12:55.525
It might've been easier
just to let her turn into a monster.

12:59.070 --> 13:02.949
I've made her suffer for a long time.

13:13.710 --> 13:16.713
Maru, Maru. Look at this.

13:22.886 --> 13:25.055
Usami, look at this.

13:39.402 --> 13:43.323
THANK YOU FOR LETTING ME DIE
AS A HUMAN

13:46.409 --> 13:48.703
THANK YOU FOR GIVING ME YOUR EYE

13:48.787 --> 13:50.997
THANK YOU

13:53.833 --> 13:58.004
THANK YOU FOR EVERYTHING

14:01.466 --> 14:06.596
I LOVE YOU

14:39.796 --> 14:43.633
Is everyone here? Anyone else hurt?

14:43.717 --> 14:46.553
Naito was the first to jump out at them.

14:47.053 --> 14:48.054
Damn it.

14:50.765 --> 14:51.766
Doctor!

14:53.018 --> 14:54.019
You're unharmed.

14:54.519 --> 14:57.647
They said something
about Mizuhashi's death and broke in.

14:57.731 --> 14:59.399
We need to regain power immediately.

14:59.482 --> 15:00.859
Or Miss Hoshio will…

15:05.488 --> 15:07.907
She's already dead.

15:07.991 --> 15:08.992
Oh.

15:11.536 --> 15:13.997
Don't tell me they…

15:15.665 --> 15:19.461
No, she died a natural death.

15:24.966 --> 15:26.801
There should be a settlement here.

15:27.552 --> 15:29.763
Can you make it there
before the sun goes down?

15:29.846 --> 15:32.140
What about you, Doctor?
You're not coming with us?

15:33.224 --> 15:37.020
I'll follow you with the guards
after giving her a burial.

15:37.562 --> 15:38.855
Go first without me.

15:43.026 --> 15:45.904
Why do we have to get chased out
of where we live?

15:47.781 --> 15:49.741
Because I killed monsters in the basement.

15:50.784 --> 15:52.452
That's why this happened, isn't it?

15:54.829 --> 15:56.081
-Maru--
-It doesn't matter.

15:59.626 --> 16:03.046
Almost all the facilities
in that building were made for her.

16:03.713 --> 16:05.215
They're no longer necessary.

16:05.298 --> 16:06.341
There are still wounded.

16:07.258 --> 16:09.678
There's a lot of people
who want to be treated by you.

16:12.013 --> 16:14.557
We were originally
two people living together.

16:15.141 --> 16:17.227
An injured man wandered into the house.

16:17.769 --> 16:20.063
I made him a prosthetic hand on a whim.

16:20.146 --> 16:22.816
Before I knew it,
more and more people arrived.

16:24.693 --> 16:27.070
Oh, yes.

16:28.947 --> 16:33.743
<i>It makes her happy when I make things.</i>

16:36.496 --> 16:38.206
That's why I made it.

16:39.916 --> 16:41.042
That's why.

16:43.420 --> 16:44.921
I am not a doctor.

16:50.593 --> 16:52.804
Wonderful.

16:53.388 --> 16:56.016
I've got the future in my hands.

16:56.099 --> 16:58.643
With this many power generators,

16:58.727 --> 17:00.478
we can build a city here.

17:02.272 --> 17:04.357
A new culture

17:04.858 --> 17:06.693
in this broken world!

17:08.945 --> 17:12.532
<i>All we need now is</i>
<i>one order and leadership.</i>

17:13.116 --> 17:14.367
<i>A nation.</i>

17:14.868 --> 17:17.287
<i>This is the end of childish factions.</i>

17:17.829 --> 17:19.789
<i>We start here!</i>

17:33.803 --> 17:35.555
Excuse me, everyone.

17:37.349 --> 17:39.351
Sorry to bother you
at this difficult time.

17:39.434 --> 17:41.394
Have you seen these two?

17:41.895 --> 17:43.605
This one is a doctor.

17:43.688 --> 17:45.857
I don't know.

17:45.940 --> 17:50.028
This forehead scar is something
I'd remember if I saw it once.

17:50.111 --> 17:53.448
In the three years I've been
with the Doctor, I've never seen him.

17:55.158 --> 17:58.703
This good-looking guy?
Isn't this Dr. Inazaki?

18:00.038 --> 18:01.039
What?

18:01.664 --> 18:04.834
Oh, yes! This is Dr. Inazaki.

18:04.918 --> 18:08.838
It was long before the Whiteshirts
started messing around.

18:08.922 --> 18:10.632
So, about two years ago.

18:10.715 --> 18:12.467
One day, without saying a word,

18:12.550 --> 18:14.928
he was just gone.

18:15.011 --> 18:18.848
He had surgical knowledge
and was studying Dr. Usami's technique.

18:19.432 --> 18:22.018
He said he's not going
to let anyone else die.

18:22.519 --> 18:23.895
He was an enthusiastic man.

18:25.480 --> 18:26.481
It's Robin.

18:28.400 --> 18:31.611
<i>It's definitely Robin.</i>
<i>I knew you were alive.</i>

18:32.779 --> 18:33.780
<i>I want to see you!</i>

18:34.447 --> 18:35.573
<i>I have to!</i>

18:37.033 --> 18:38.159
Sis.

18:41.871 --> 18:44.040
Are you going to guard Usami?

18:44.124 --> 18:45.458
Oh.

18:45.542 --> 18:49.879
Oh, it's just the way things went.

18:52.007 --> 18:54.467
-You also want to know about Robin.
-Wha--

18:55.093 --> 18:56.970
Of course I'll ask about him.

18:57.053 --> 18:58.179
Okay, okay.

19:05.061 --> 19:07.105
Isn't Usami done yet?

20:44.035 --> 20:45.036
What--

20:47.580 --> 20:48.623
Damn it.

20:52.502 --> 20:53.503
Maru?

20:55.839 --> 21:00.260
I'm the total opposite of Usami and Robin.

21:02.721 --> 21:03.847
My hands…

21:06.057 --> 21:07.767
bring only death!

21:10.020 --> 21:12.188
Idiot!

21:13.314 --> 21:15.775
Don't say that.

21:17.402 --> 21:19.362
Don't you dare say that.

21:20.321 --> 21:23.324
When you kill Man-eaters,

21:23.408 --> 21:25.076
people won't be eaten anymore.

21:25.577 --> 21:27.704
You're saving everyone's life!

22:15.710 --> 22:18.463
THEIR CHOICES

22:30.225 --> 22:32.727
I wonder where I am.

22:33.937 --> 22:35.647
It's dark.

22:38.775 --> 22:39.859
Somehow

22:40.777 --> 22:42.195
I hate it.

22:49.411 --> 22:50.620
It's scary.

23:01.756 --> 23:03.174
You came!

23:06.344 --> 23:07.345
Well, then.

23:08.847 --> 23:10.056
It's not scary.

23:21.901 --> 23:24.070
Why are you grinning all by yourself?

23:26.406 --> 23:28.366
I don't know.

23:28.950 --> 23:31.453
I had a dream that made me happy.

23:32.037 --> 23:33.663
What kind?

23:38.001 --> 23:39.878
I don't remember anymore.
